sequenceDiagram
    participant CS as Compose Screen
    participant H as Hilt (generated)
    participant VM as SearchViewModel
    participant UC as SearchProductsUseCase
    participant REPO as CatalogRepository
    participant INFRA as OkHttp/Room/Dispatchers
    CS->>H: hiltViewModel()
    H->>INFRA: resolve singletons (cached)
    H->>REPO: @Binds impl (singleton, cached)
    H->>UC: @Inject(Repo)
    H->>VM: @Inject(UC, SavedStateHandle)
    H-->>CS: SearchViewModel
    Note over CS,H: entire graph validated at COMPILE time
